; The multi-interface component fixture, ROOT scope (WIT interface `types`).
;
; Its record reaches into the `sub` scope, which is what makes the emitted package carry a
; cross-interface `use` and the guest glue mint an `own` handle for a resource ANOTHER interface
; declares — the two multi-interface facts a single-scope fixture cannot reach. Deliberately free of
; externs, so unlike `tests/multifile` the generated rust crate builds with no hand-written
; re-exports and the wasip2 build smoke can consume it.

